  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pokemon_Legacy/BH_Pokemon_Legacy_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">想像一個世界，經典的《Minecraft》體驗與《寶可夢》的魔法和刺激完美融合！想像自己探索廣闊的生態域，尋找你最喜愛的生物，訓練牠們，並在充滿冒險的世界中進行對戰。透過這個模組包，你將獲得《Minecraft》最佳原版版本的所有樂趣，但有一個令人驚喜的轉折：寶可夢來了！</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pokemon_Legacy/BH_Pokemon_Legacy_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">深入體驗一個獨特的冒險，結合了《Minecraft》的精華與迷人的《寶可夢》世界。探索無盡的生態域，捕捉你最喜愛的生物，訓練你的隊伍，並在刺激的對戰中與訓練家一決高下。透過這個模組包，《寶可夢》的魔法無縫融入經典的《Minecraft》遊戲玩法，提供一種全新的遊戲享受方式，讓你可以建立自己的隊伍，探索充滿可能性的宇宙。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>這個模組包的主要特色包括：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">✔️ 來自不同世代的各式各樣《寶可夢》。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">✔️ 一個開放的《Minecraft》世界，你可以在其中捕捉和訓練你的寶可夢。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">✔️ 經典風格的動態寶可夢對戰。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">✔️ 與其他《Minecraft》模組的兼容性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">✔️ 使用獨特物品和升級來客製化你的隊伍。</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>想和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pokemon_Legacy/BH_Pokemon_Legacy_promo2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"251\"></strong></a></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>立即獲取你自己的 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">，與朋友一起享受無盡的冒險！憑藉頂級性能和可靠的運行時間，我們的伺服器保證為所有人提供流暢且有趣的遊戲體驗。使用代碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong> </a>可獲得</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">25% 折扣！</span></strong></a></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pokemon_Legacy/BH_Pokemon_Legacy_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232165/description_361667f4-5e87-4a1e-83d1-159e0f04059b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232165/description_ed0be727-63f8-42fc-99d4-5f727373177c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232165/description_0adf7206-616e-4801-8adc-7296dfe0f9a9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FqhuAjYTGv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pokemon_Legacy/BH_Pokemon_Legacy_discord.webp\"></span></a></p>",
